L1:(b)(1) Insert the clause at 252.217-7027, Contract Definitization, in—
L3:(i) All UCAs;
L3:(ii) Solicitations associated with UCAs;
L3:(iii) Basic ordering agreements;
L3:(iv) Indefinite delivery contracts;
L3:(v) Any other type of contract providing for the use of UCAs; or
