L2:(2) Insert the applicable information in paragraphs (a), (b), and (d) of the clause.
L2:(3) If, at the time of entering into the UCA or unpriced change order, the contracting officer knows that the definitive contract action will meet the criteria of FAR 15.403-1 or 15.403-2 for not requiring submission of certified cost or pricing data, the contracting officer may delete the words “and certified cost or pricing data” from paragraph (a) of the clause.

L0:222.404-1 Administration.
L1:(b)(1) Upon award of the contract, provide the prime contractor a preconstruction letter to describing the following, as appropriate—
L3:(i) Indicate that the labor standards requirements contained in the contract are based on the following statutes and regulations—
