6.102-1 Establishing or maintaining alternative sources

L1:(a) Agencies may exclude a particular source from a contract action to establish or maintain an alternative source of supply for that supply or service if the agency head determines that to do so would—
L2:(1) Increase or maintain competition and likely result in reduced overall costs for the acquisition, or anticipated acquisition, of the supplies or services;
